[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     35[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     36[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis E — state interaction / ordering.** `array` is persistent global state:
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     37[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `A2` before any `A3`; `A3` then `A2`; `A3` twice; caller-poisoned `array` then
