[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     39[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     40[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Axis F — cargo features.** `debug-stats` (stderr only) and default. Every row
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     41[0m:[38;5;10m[49m below is run under both.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     42[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     43[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Observable compared in every row (byte-for-byte):** all 262144 `int`s of
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     44[0m:[38;5;10m[49m `array` after the call (1 MiB `memcmp`), *and* the exact stdout bytes when `A3`
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     45[0m:[38;5;10m[49m is involved.
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     46[0m:[38;5;10m[49m 
[0m[49m[38;5;10m+     47[0m:[38;5;10m[49m **Randomisation:** rows marked *(random)* are run with many independently
